 GP: average loss +380.2%, CVaR +369.9%\r\n","- LFBO: average loss +13.6%, CVaR +63.8%\r\n","- PFN: average loss +82.0%, CVaR +120.3%\r\n","- MetaGameBO (original): average loss -96.7%, CVaR -91.6%\r\n","- MetaGameBO (remake): average loss +21.7%, CVaR -2.7%\r\n","\r\n","Notes:\r\n","- Paper: MetaGameBO 0.0183 / 0.0934 (−95.7% average loss vs MALIBO 0.4277 / 0.8195).\r\n","- All methods use the LFBO/author labelling of Eq. (3): every good point appears as class 1 (EI weight) and as class 0, so the loss has an irreducible floor > 0.\r\n","- MetaGameBO (original) reports the author trainer's own held-out split; the other rows share one split per seed.\r\n","- Random, GP, LFBO and PFN are not meta-trained: each task's classifier is fitted on that task's training points only (≈ 25 points).\r\n","\r\n","wrote /kaggle/working/results/forrester_benchmark.md and /kaggle/working/results/forrester_plot.png\r\n","/usr/lib/python3.13/multiprocessing/resource_tracker.py:479: UserWarning: resource_tracker: There appear to be 4 leaked semaphore objects to clean up at shutdown: {'/loky-100-xi7d3a33', '/loky-97-uytx1z9i', '/loky-99-d6knesxx', '/loky-98-v41m77pr'}\r\n","  warnings.warn(\r\n","[kaggle_run 13:03:28] /kaggle/working/results: 70 finished jobs, 0 checkpoints of unfinished jobs\r\n","[kaggle_run 13:03:28] all done\r\n"]}],"source":["!cd /tmp/repo && python kaggle_run.py --benchmarks forrester --hours 10"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"e5f8c94d","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.027795,"end_time":"2026-11-20T13:03:29.345733+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-20T13:03:29.317938+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":[]}],"metadata":{"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":22327617}],"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false},"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"cod